[00:05.08]Jehovah, this is the day;
[00:09.24]Now from our hearts, we want to pray.
[00:15.99]How you have honored us, favored us,
[00:23.22]More than words can say!
[00:29.02]Upon our labor of love,
[00:35.02]We’ve seen your blessing from above.
[00:40.92]And now a building stands, by our hands,
[00:47.26]As the proof thereof.
[00:52.77](Chorus)
[00:52.92]Jehovah God, it was a priv’lege
[00:58.52]For us to build this place for you.
[01:03.82]May we continue in your service throughout our days
[01:13.96]And bring you praise in all we do.
[01:29.02]What happy faces we see,
[01:33.16]And what good friends we’ve come to be!
[01:40.96]And how we’ll cherish these memories
[01:47.38]For eternity!
[01:52.83]We saw your spirit, O Lord,
[01:58.88]In how we worked with one accord.
[02:04.92]And how we’ve added fame to your name;
[02:11.26]What a grand reward!
[02:16.87](Chorus)
[02:17.02]Jehovah God, it was a priv’lege
[02:22.58]For us to build this place for you.
[02:28.86]May we continue in your service throughout our days
[02:37.90]And bring you praise in all we do.
